Package: vabaxos-communication
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: firefox-esr
Description: WhatsApp, Telegram and video calls, in the Start menu
 WhatsApp Web, Telegram Web and Jitsi Meet, each in its own Firefox window,
 the versions that work best with the screen reader on Linux; the guide
 "Messaggi e videochiamate" gives their keys.
